            <title>0.7.23</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:59:37 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202610271158</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.23</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><body><p>Bookings sit where the work happened: each block is booked at its time, rounded to the booking unit, and short blocks join the task next to them (Settings → Minimum block length). The menu bar shows the last half hour minute by minute.</p></body></html>
]]></description>
