            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><body><p>The 'Absorb interruptions up to' setting now applies to every short stretch, so the timeline has no blocks shorter than it.</p></body></html>
]]></description>
